    // Option A). Block = [rc=1@base, data@base+8, len@base+16] (24 bytes, freelist
    // class 3); box = base+8, so data@box+0 / len@box+8 (byte-identical to the old
    // raw-16 layout, so every string CONSUMER — len/index/slice/concat/eq — is
    // unchanged) and rc@box-8 rides the SAME rc word as arrays (__fern_rc_inc /
    // __fn___fern_rc_is_unique read -8(ptr)). Freed by the rc-aware __fern_str_free at
    // rc==1. The single choke point for every reclaimable string box (const_str +
    // raw_string), the asm sibling of the wasm $__fern_str_box.
